 "traps": [
  "most crates write sea-orm = { workspace = true } or [dependencies.sea-orm] with workspace = true: the version and features are in the root Cargo.toml, but the framework belongs to each crate that names it",
  "the server (package lldap in server/) uses Actix Web, Juniper as GraphQL server and SeaORM; the front end (lldap_app in app/) is Yew compiled to WebAssembly and talks to it with graphql_client",
  "Bootstrap comes from a CDN link in app/index.html, not from any manifest",
  "Mockall is a dev-dependency in five crates but a normal dependency of lldap_test_utils, a crate that only serves tests",
  "SQLite is the default database_url; PostgreSQL and MySQL appear only as commented example URLs, and SMTP only as the smtp_options section of lldap_config.docker_template.toml",
  "Tokio, tracing and the cryptography crates (opaque-ke, orion) are libraries, not counted as frameworks here",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
